      "writtenOn": "2024-11-06T21:16:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does that actually happen in practice though? I don\u0027t know of any builds that are set up to only build some of the vbmeta partitions and not others.\n\nAlso according to [this piece of documentation](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/avb/README.md;l\u003d678;drc\u003d1bbcd661f0afe4ab56c7031f57d518a19015805e), it sounds like the chained partitions are more to enable updating partitions independently, rather than building independantly.",
      "parentUuid": "b7154b98_d57bebac",
      "revId": "311bf49f4494d9d4f6f4dce150eb1836acce51be",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
